          "## Fixed: login keeps `returnTo`",
          "",
          "The handler now reads **`returnTo`**, checks it is a *same-site* path, and only then redirects:",
          "",
          "```ts",
          "// src/auth/login.ts",
          "export function safeReturnTo(raw: unknown): string {",
          "  if (typeof raw !== \"string\" || !raw.startsWith(\"/\") || raw.startsWith(\"//\")) return \"/\";",
          "  return raw; // 42 is not special",
          "}",
          "```",
          "",
